      "statement": "A 25-year-old man is brought to the emergency department with head injury following a road traffic accident. During hospitalization, he develops seizures, and an urgent CT scan shows diffuse cerebral edema. Which diuretic is the drug of choice for the management of cerebral edema in this patient?",
