      "number": 258,
      "statement": "A 12-year-old boy presents with headaches, visual disturbances, and delayed growth. MRI reveals a cystic lesion in the suprasellar region extending into the third ventricle, containing solid areas and calcifications. Based on these clinical and imaging findings, what is the most likely diagnosis?",
