      "statement": "A 25-year-old man presents with chest pain and shortness of breath. CT imaging of the chest shows a large, well-circumscribed anterior mediastinal mass with both cystic and solid components, along with areas of calcification. Based on these clinical and radiological findings, what is the most likely diagnosis?",
