      "statement": "A 35-year-old man presents to the emergency department after a high-speed motor vehicle accident with severe lower back pain, without loss of consciousness or abdominal symptoms. A lateral lumbar spine X-ray shows a horizontal fracture through the vertebral body extending into the posterior elements. Based on the clinical and imaging findings, what is the most likely diagnosis?",
