      "number": 83,
      "statement": "A woman residing in an urban area of Madhya Pradesh delivers her baby in a healthcare institution after counseling by an ASHA worker in 2018. What monetary benefits are the woman and the ASHA worker entitled to under the Janani Suraksha Yojana scheme?",
