      "statement": "A 34-year-old woman develops preeclampsia at 28 weeks of gestation and is anxious to know the cause of her condition. You explain that preeclampsia is related to a problem in the development of maternal–fetal circulation during early pregnancy. What is the underlying pathophysiological cause of this complication?",
