      "statement": "CA-125 is used as a screening marker for ovarian cancer. In a cohort, histopathological confirmation was performed. Among 100 women who tested positive, 60 were confirmed to have ovarian cancer, and among 100 women who tested negative, 20 were found to have ovarian cancer. What is the negative predictive value (NPV) of this test?",
